{"media_id": 3734479247142672825, "shortcode": "DPTiRbTAdm5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPTiRbTAdm5/", "taken_at": "2025-10-02T11:30:00", "caption": "沒有看到廣告的 你們一定會後悔", "owner_username": "1g0104.x3", "owner_id": "76640488905", "likes": 11069, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DPTiRbTAdm5\\DPTiRbTAdm5_20251002_113000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18080257789966405, "text": "模特真的蠻喜歡的感覺 但他們兩位的氣質也很好欸 好喜歡😍有沒有ig可以追（喂", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:13:33", "owner": "ayanayou", "likes": 187}, {"id": 17956671359991195, "text": "有女模特ig嗎真的好美😍", "created_at": "2025-10-03T06:30:14", "owner": "s5983788", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18350109469206829, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:05:30", "owner": "01_buyfans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044722493380169, "text": "好期待新品上市😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:47:40", "owner": "chaoyuhsuan__", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18042742136424490, "text": "兩個模特的臉蛋也太好看🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:13:48", "owner": "weihong_c", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18045887450353647, "text": "女模特好美😍", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:05:14", "owner": "diver0921", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18007931006800699, "text": "什么时候卖大陆😍", "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:41:15", "owner": "zhangjj1216_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922854487153436, "text": "模特好好看😍", "created_at": "2025-10-02T11:41:35", "owner": "eeeeeva99", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066618560037252, "text": "😍老師要不要往大陸發展下，我們需要您！！", "created_at": "2025-10-02T21:18:37", "owner": "harumi_9624", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18089584465936410, "text": "女好美 男好帥😮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:53:50", "owner": "bone_1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072584530917092, "text": "模特的反應好好玩", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:28:45", "owner": "kan09.07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084877826504877, "text": "求女model的IG👏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:30:31", "owner": "weichelai916", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18021751178771286, "text": "有門嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:08:38", "owner": "vickchen1124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088676569876497, "text": "女模特有ins号吗，好美啊", "created_at": "2025-10-03T19:00:44", "owner": "lhz01072122", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18149045809389642, "text": "这女主好好看啊！", "created_at": "2025-12-21T03:44:53", "owner": "weilekanmeinv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081935146980477, "text": "右边是哪个mm啊", "created_at": "2025-10-03T01:10:59", "owner": "xugouxjizhu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18519474043064637, "text": "有女模特的ig嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:12:30", "owner": "y_oghh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875964760425418, "text": "大陆可以买到正版吗", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:45:50", "owner": "xc070131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118257880458953, "text": "❤", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:22:00", "owner": "wuzhihang66666666", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074129222328628, "text": "比較想看1G試試", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:56:55", "owner": "tingtzu1004", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108732922517596, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:17:36", "owner": "zhangchen5429", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866951551395282, "text": "有在賣了嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:57:47", "owner": "xx8308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008386439640734, "text": "這位外國女生真漂亮", "created_at": "2025-10-19T03:31:10", "owner": "malk22190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029252024773479, "text": "真的很討厭你", "created_at": "2025-10-09T19:32:11", "owner": "sway_0906", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067359701090666, "text": "我也想", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:58:54", "owner": "nima387699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090817513889375, "text": "湾湾真把自己当回事了", "created_at": "2025-10-09T00:51:22", "owner": "cai94108", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099941284650148, "text": "考不考虑往大陆发展一下产品", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:28:40", "owner": "kar1sonnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857535148538023, "text": "女生是Urassaya Sperbund ?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:27:48", "owner": "_wei.ace", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18068913908056643, "text": "废材 好好去看看大陆在校大学生拍的广告吧 还盗你？ 湾仔你真的把自己当回事了", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:33:29", "owner": "salonmomo_jason", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3729573187043645291, "shortcode": "DPCGw2xjtdr", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPCGw2xjtdr/", "taken_at": "2025-09-25T17:03:45", "caption": "lol couldn’t remember it 60 minutes later means didn’t really want it", "owner_username": "buybye_app", "owner_id": "72936341153", "likes": 274488, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0002_DPCGw2xjtdr\\DPCGw2xjtdr_20250925_170345.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18082736678008322, "text": "No way there's an audience for apps for basic decision making?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:02:49", "owner": "itsmepale", "likes": 5792}, {"id": 18078830627007340, "text": "This is such a clever idea!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:31:23", "owner": "holler.academy", "likes": 10406}, {"id": 18078419279087302, "text": "Crazy that it was 2:20 when he set the one hour timer and 2:24 when the timer were finished", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:38:25", "owner": "ziatxebee", "likes": 14613}, {"id": 18046079975663815, "text": "It was 2:20 when he set the one-hour timer, and 2:24 when the timer was signaled, clearly staged, maybe an ad for an app or something like that.  Honestly, ads need to be CLEARLY labeled as ads to remove any ambiguity from scams.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T14:44:28", "owner": "jillpkitten", "likes": 4613}, {"id": 17903167752327615, "text": "as someone with ADHD I love this idea", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:44:31", "owner": "vile.violets", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18131250121472617, "text": "Diese Idee ist so gut!😍", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:11:56", "owner": "kaffee.mit.kess", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18062315819564162, "text": "This totally makes sense for people with ADHD or other impulsive people. Or even the people who can’t pass up a “deal”", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:22:13", "owner": "rhaundel", "likes": 3754}, {"id": 18083829658749295, "text": "Guys use an alarm and you notes and calculator rather than paying monthly for a saving app", "created_at": "2025-10-07T14:59:08", "owner": "lana_sukhodolska", "likes": 957}, {"id": 18181088914343657, "text": "This is actually such a good idea lol", "created_at": "2025-10-22T01:23:14", "owner": "meghanmakesmoney", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17906961528252906, "text": "She was technically right because it was 129.99 not 130", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:37:26", "owner": "lucy_james_26", "likes": 2758}, {"id": 18039655040466701, "text": "$143,000 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:18:59", "owner": "bartonek.ondrej", "likes": 946}, {"id": 18082130356751190, "text": "How about you make an option where the clock gets set to however long the amount is worth so if it’s worth 4.5 hours worth of your work then you have to wait 4.5 hours to think about it.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:32:58", "owner": "trevincoker", "likes": 2096}, {"id": 18431464132100393, "text": "Being at the store for a hour tho is crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:34:29", "owner": "jacksonfry08", "likes": 206}, {"id": 18079428860282375, "text": "Waste of time button------>", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:07:54", "owner": "bombart.12", "likes": 184}, {"id": 18105263593522588, "text": "\"Se isso for menos de 15 dias de trabalho, eu compro\" 🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:48:38", "owner": "marcelo.mnck", "likes": 793}, {"id": 18093820078905072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:23:10", "owner": "vgoud55", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333996721241815, "text": "This is so smart", "created_at": "2025-12-20T12:34:29", "owner": "is_this_amanda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982173312924746, "text": "O problema é que eu fico obcecado com coisas superficiais, passo dias pensado nelas e quando compro esqueço 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:49:41", "owner": "maruporai", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17974289759793516, "text": "Very nice but getting a subscription to save doesn't work for me. I have 0 subs. And i like it that way. I want a one time buy or free.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:23:56", "owner": "lisa_acb", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18087024362101981, "text": "This would be great but I can’t justify a subscription app to save money.. kinda counterproductive..", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:27:04", "owner": "le111f", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18029605733566309, "text": "But aaactually the price was 129,99, doesn’t that make it 6 hours? 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:22:59", "owner": "julekiks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031896284756635, "text": "Isnt it more useful to think: do i have it? Do i need it? How long will it last? What is the impact of it buying new?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:28:05", "owner": "bodhimari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877556875353867, "text": "Love this idea, but why does the app have so much tracking info", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:01:20", "owner": "cheesegriled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085794761081047, "text": "You can totally do it without the app...!", "created_at": "2025-12-14T23:06:51", "owner": "aboutortellini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930649900112311, "text": "My technique: visite the store, give you like a week to think about it, if you still want it. Usually they ran out of it or changed the collection : money saved, frustration earned", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:05:43", "owner": "pip024", "likes": 269}, {"id": 18179184835366628, "text": "you have to pay for a budgeting app? seems counterintuitive", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:07:52", "owner": "waxwings.jpeg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869805382490990, "text": "If you have forgotten you have forgotten....", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:30:01", "owner": "jennyvella", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064094483419655, "text": "Jesus, what a depressing time to be alive", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:19:24", "owner": "egopinonero", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17908304538272570, "text": "the app is 81$ \"FOR A MONTH\" BRO DAMN.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:20:00", "owner": "atalar_efe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128456581500479, "text": "Wait what’s that?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:39:04", "owner": "azuos.concce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331961860212856, "text": "Can we please shop second hand", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:22:27", "owner": "ismaaillio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049229201447537, "text": "Its 129,99 not 130. Maybe that fit with 6 hours😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:58:19", "owner": "castielnovak_95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102391288676219, "text": "As someone who has ADHD and does struggle with impulsivity at times this is a great idea but as someone who hates that everything is a subscription these days I wouldn’t pay monthly for this.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:26:52", "owner": "enyaozcelik_photography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061486430259720, "text": "6 hours of work for a footstool is wild", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:54:56", "owner": "myfreakinusername", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18196136371332963, "text": "Just makes you pay for it 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-20T02:44:46", "owner": "esmexprivate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081820580327717, "text": "crazy work that an app for reducing spending costs money", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:47:02", "owner": "wren__the_chemist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096928381872210, "text": "You can’t figure this out in your head?", "created_at": "2025-12-18T05:44:10", "owner": "justusdustbunnies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071810384458524, "text": "The first ad for an app that isn’t bullshit nor useless. People saying it is useless, the quote “If you don’t understand the device, the device isn’t for you.” Should stick lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:29:19", "owner": "oppatwunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866002252523673, "text": "This is pathetic", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:57:50", "owner": "droorzn_xrksvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286464751260727, "text": "You pay the app to be told not to spend money 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:25:44", "owner": "julie_chrm", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17931848727111097, "text": "Yeah, uhhhh, if there wasn't subscription for the app it'd be better", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:12:42", "owner": "bellybytestudio", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17868499281491020, "text": "Six hours of work? What does that mean. It’s a pre built footstool", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:00:53", "owner": "daniellitempel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958564327033900, "text": "That is so nice!! How does it work?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:49:55", "owner": "juni_jupi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971251440972916, "text": "Do it for the relationship", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:42:30", "owner": "hallucinations_cr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078679340181888, "text": "Y’all this is important because corporations have severely messed up Americans relationship with their money.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:18:22", "owner": "nate.loveridge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18425368786112916, "text": "Your should have put 129. Not 130, it could have changed the time of work. She could have gotten that stool.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:17:27", "owner": "jude.stars11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337841482228229, "text": "129,99 maybe is 6 hours \nAnd 130 is 6:01", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:14:15", "owner": "eduardoconte32", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045912704682351, "text": "The app costs money", "created_at": "2025-10-28T23:27:56", "owner": "roxy_6_fops", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18114049405550014, "text": "Don't waste your time, the app doesn't have a free version and you won't even see the concept until you put your credit card in. For an app that can be vibe coded in less than 10 min", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:41:04", "owner": "loot_motion", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18141168175451017, "text": "It won’t be a free app", "created_at": "2025-11-03T06:28:34", "owner": "tink__1999", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18435043888098669, "text": "Is it free?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:09:15", "owner": "john.sadiwa12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055662356201790, "text": "This is just sad btw", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:39:08", "owner": "bochra_tn1", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18088264489938734, "text": "Is it free to use ?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:47:51", "owner": "zainal_allani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909564562254544, "text": "This app costs money btw", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:10:11", "owner": "jaedyndaemon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058084022303241, "text": "You can use your brain to do that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:12:17", "owner": "blitzxc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065833064576877, "text": "Just installed it let's see if my money spending habits slow down", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:56", "owner": "bieritamara", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901594240326527, "text": "I just downloaded it lol. The holy grail of saving!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:16", "owner": "yall.r.weird.asf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993884118712809, "text": "$130 NETTO for 6 hours. Damn I want her salary!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:28:34", "owner": "xxmaryartsxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132193369489200, "text": "When is it coming to android?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:58:38", "owner": "_gummyren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087411254311404, "text": "Then why do we have to pay for your app 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:45:56", "owner": "hhhhan.s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046446365465131, "text": "Bulgaria lookin", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:59:15", "owner": "brendan_childish95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899981266322856, "text": "@buybye_app your app for saving money cost 16 bucks per month?😂😂 ahahahhhaaaa hell nah. I'll start saving now with deinstalling it right away. No wonder you have a 1,2 Star rating 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:41:34", "owner": "kiri_chaotic_new", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087262648789746, "text": "Luckily I don’t need this app I get $50 an hour so it’s very easy to calculate the hours to get it", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:35:05", "owner": "off_the_record6401", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068771396579317, "text": "Hell yeah 😍😍 i need thst app", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:18:21", "owner": "kiri_chaotic_new", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100295770742549, "text": "Why is this wierd focus on saving money? I don't work to deny myself the pleasure of spending and owning random stuff.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:55:28", "owner": "b_cathexis_s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916162213219237, "text": "It’s not free so it’s basically a scam for your money ironic 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:31:34", "owner": "harrietrosewade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057037409532236, "text": "That’s not saving money…", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:53:36", "owner": "graysondavisgymnastics", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17989961936856692, "text": "Yaaaay Let’s make poverty fun!👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:07:51", "owner": "juanjo1598", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18179578522357856, "text": "There is no currency except dollar", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:55:18", "owner": "cndn_furkan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998780052814738, "text": "Maybe I need this? @thejwmb", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:49:01", "owner": "poppyannabel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18399556123124187, "text": "Ooo ok", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:50:58", "owner": "emberlys_mom08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184500184352439, "text": "I can’t find the app in Apple Store😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:30:08", "owner": "strzeszynekk18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105837067614645, "text": "It was actually 129 so I guess it will save that 1 minute", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:08:05", "owner": "araujo_life", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18118549465550448, "text": "You've gotta pay for a monthly subscription for it", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:23:59", "owner": "btaylor207", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086628277948178, "text": "What's the app", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:49:48", "owner": "page._.charlie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071759843047990, "text": "Does it work for Android?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:33:47", "owner": "funnyyseal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18514577236064853, "text": "I don't get it", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:05:57", "owner": "zril33_arm6n", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025919561761880, "text": "people are getting dumber with each day", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:48:41", "owner": "ko.ssio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074167013218779, "text": "But how should this Work because you Tip in the price but the App doesnt know wich Item it is because it could be any Item that cost 130 Dollars or smth how does that Work", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:08:18", "owner": "for_realsarah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009676955805597, "text": "Türkiyede delirmelik", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:18:31", "owner": "gecenin3undeymisim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18293566204269084, "text": "I need this app but for calories", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:34:54", "owner": "nmparrott99", "likes": 147}, {"id": 18077757458324169, "text": "This would be good if I didn't have to PAY for the app.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:25:41", "owner": "freakshow.spn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066758063099809, "text": "Not me saying to myself “you only make $21.50 an hour?”", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:58:13", "owner": "la_reem13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18539312188054301, "text": "Am I the only one confused about the 6 hours of work?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:40:08", "owner": "captainkirk2986", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893743993346438, "text": "ahhhhhhh i get it", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:22:25", "owner": "luxinda.04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406533628138322, "text": "Damn, I've been using the same method my whole life, should have capitalised on it 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:31:44", "owner": "senlifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990358032895945, "text": "One hour in 4 minutes? He set the timer at 2:20 and it was 2:24 when the timer ended?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T22:26:56", "owner": "nidhi_madhav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074203208351283, "text": "Coisa mais triste", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:56:09", "owner": "call._.ixto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082518463808683, "text": "Так!!! Звучит как выход! Возьмите мои деньги!", "created_at": "2025-10-18T12:02:48", "owner": "_lesya_guseva_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889856080366497, "text": "I do this but I just take a picture", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:33:14", "owner": "livitup83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902887273148108, "text": "I love downloading a *free* to download app just for it to not be able to be used without paying up front. Ok", "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:50:08", "owner": "mors.archangelus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060319670566534, "text": "Wait I didn’t understand…", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:54:21", "owner": "mael_2209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985292997863731, "text": "Nah, ill use my own brain, thanks", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:00:38", "owner": "uplne_jinej_dan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101372905651208, "text": "I can do the same app under 2 days with better icons duh whats this and u guys want money ? Yeah imma just  make my own", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:42:22", "owner": "ardacemmill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051926576645576, "text": "How do people need an app to divide the price by your hourly wages", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:13:57", "owner": "groenerobin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079330784320913, "text": "People don’t need an app for everything", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:11:39", "owner": "sammkroll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127441906478959, "text": "Yoooo I mean cool idea but I can do this with a calculator - $amount / hourly rate = amount of hours you had yo work to afford it 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-05T04:18:00", "owner": "itstonispriv", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18101222050658941, "text": "My 6 hours consists of 60. How tf are you getting 130?!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:29:51", "owner": "nmcgeown21", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18038525918704551, "text": "Im tired of y'all", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:53:44", "owner": "muffinbayun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969639075973586, "text": "He pisses me off it’s 129.99 like it says not 130", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:15:36", "owner": "kyle.22__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127206538519338, "text": "lol 4 minutes passed", "created_at": "2025-12-21T06:48:29", "owner": "heidijeangreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988633344874612, "text": "This app is great until I find out it’s not free. You want charge me so I can save money?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T20:47:30", "owner": "chrdav13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031815437685316, "text": "You can do the same thing with ur phone calculator and timer I have ADHD and a shopping addiction and I think this is totally useless", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:20:06", "owner": "purplwombatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119645998528411, "text": "App is free but u have to pay every month 🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:28:40", "owner": "itsaudrey_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050782814372304, "text": "Bro now 1 $ ist 1,200,000 in iran and we get  250 $ in every month and yeah 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:09:41", "owner": "radiixn.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063744734154116, "text": "It was 129.99 and u put 130 if u put 129.99 it would be 6 hours cheater", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:23:48", "owner": "marcohalabrin99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113713840583603, "text": "App is paid btw 🙃 with a monthly subscription", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:07:46", "owner": "_inactive.a.c.c.o.u.n.t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948504462924667, "text": "@valentine_delville y a ta cousine au usa mdrrr", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:30:42", "owner": "isabelleguiot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915508837223367, "text": "@dannilou24", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:54:11", "owner": "chrisashton823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086037331746910, "text": "I think I just need the personal assistant.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T12:26:14", "owner": "jklewis.netherlands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988592121896906, "text": "yall understand they're collecting data right?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:35:57", "owner": "evertrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985077627906456, "text": "the most funniest thing is it asks you to write a review in the app before you even use it or give it you money", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:38:39", "owner": "ledokins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093224467886091, "text": "@ryan.jon", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:13:27", "owner": "estelle2929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085260709781117, "text": "App", "created_at": "2025-10-20T23:25:08", "owner": "_coolliamcb_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110072863601592, "text": "You can also try the chrome extension Work Hours Price Converter that adds info on Amazon, it's free and open source", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:12:47", "owner": "dandpz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005519522819393, "text": "What does the price tell you about how much work you need to put into it?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:39:35", "owner": "ryan_t_boswell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952773166011667, "text": "Everyone complaining about the time being 4 mins like dude they aren’t going to wait 1 hour in a store just to present their app", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:01:55", "owner": "t.r.a.l.e_1290", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061099748573163, "text": "dumb thought process, how long would it take you to build yourself/source and buy the materials…", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:05:33", "owner": "bluntmonarch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082034986831141, "text": "If you have to be reminded about it, you probably don't need it", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:28:06", "owner": "josh_hamelin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076917029276183, "text": "A great app to gather consumer trends based on income. Very smart.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:15:24", "owner": "pastelito3d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043935968447768, "text": "130 is 6 hours ? An hour is … 22?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:03:56", "owner": "dc443_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063307703596000, "text": "F that hate, sick app", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:57:48", "owner": "mitchell.b02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928562824103863, "text": "@beamaebriones i need", "created_at": "2025-10-16T00:38:23", "owner": "_aikspics", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069989609211063, "text": "Y’all can’t do anything without an app omfg", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:03:09", "owner": "melody.farrell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084889243943294, "text": "The dont know what is was about was so fake but i love the app ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:58:06", "owner": "menavandijkhuizen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848934922577890, "text": "you dont need an app for that, just stay by this: if you dont remember it 1hr later its not worth it any you dont really want it", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:09:03", "owner": "norambling", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069961385585672, "text": "At first I thought it was one of those hehehaha satire on capitalism kind of videos. But this is a real thing… says a lot about society…", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:27:57", "owner": "onlosingdog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955321102001682, "text": "so just a calculator?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:55:09", "owner": "huseyinhelibol", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863161741482431, "text": "Lol by this logic you could „save” more money that you earn", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:23:32", "owner": "grzyzio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859156882454609, "text": "Lol 6hrs. Its 3hrs for me", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:41:59", "owner": "swain_blake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18362301466087731, "text": "More Currencies", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:46:33", "owner": "alejovelez905", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054376664633748, "text": "So you mean they turned the anxiety of calculating the value of our time into an app ? No thanks, my mind did it years ago", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:07:44", "owner": "amr_ayyad", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080062061084394, "text": "Did u do that with ur dog too ?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T21:31:47", "owner": "lilya_4evr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025099646774742, "text": "@downsizeupgrade Neat tool that could complement the deliberation checklist", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:21:29", "owner": "leahlynheron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321940891215146, "text": "We have absolutely no self control.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:53:12", "owner": "heatherdidwhat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952256272013828, "text": "Como que sabe quantas horas demorou pra saber só digitando o preço? Hahahahahahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-11T13:58:02", "owner": "aanitaborges", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094207969750280, "text": "Why tf it's not free🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:54:20", "owner": "1ajx_0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18104344540550892, "text": "The best thing about this is it isn't six hours of work. You buy things with disposable income. If you make 5k a month but have 4k of necessary bills, you only have 1k a month of actual disposable income. Do your math with that number and you'll notice things are a lot more expensive and a lot less enticing.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:18:30", "owner": "_marc._.s_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980365140868772, "text": "What kind of capitalism is this😭", "created_at": "2025-10-11T09:06:55", "owner": "itsheliazahedi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052463045309798, "text": "So the app is a wrapper for just price/your hourly salary? Its a pay to use calculator 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:36:17", "owner": "ahlentim", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077463893514576, "text": "So you cannot divide by 20", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:22:00", "owner": "bjornacebjork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283690969273696, "text": "Paid app btw so you have to pay another subscription unnecessary one just to save money somewhere else… imagine that irony", "created_at": "2025-10-10T20:08:34", "owner": "yea_bunny_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17882437986400020, "text": "@solalalalo", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:06:41", "owner": "_jkssssi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052624526304172, "text": "If I forgot about it I definitely don’t need a reminder on whether I wanted it", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:21:40", "owner": "yenlyng", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18067588295361382, "text": "This app seems pretty good but you gotta pay", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:53:54", "owner": "anafakoala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073343516240236, "text": "@finanzfabio gueti Funktione 😉", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:46:23", "owner": "miatalady1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863436208478377, "text": "I do the free version of this. I take a picture of the item and put it in a folder on my phone(price and all.) I usually forget about the item. I think there been 1 item in the past 5 years I've thought about.", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:24:59", "owner": "coffincino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083703169779167, "text": "Hi! Just downloaded the app, already love it, the issue is that I use IPhone 12 and I cannot put in my salary bcs the layout, the space to write answers is on the “next” button, if you guys could fix it it’d be wonderful, cant wait to try the app!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:41:37", "owner": "its.me.floss", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17886112539381956, "text": "never downloaded an app so fast in my life", "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:20:59", "owner": "c.j.974", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069049541352007, "text": "This app costing money…", "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:19:15", "owner": "samgbeadle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18319457386209754, "text": "This is crazy!", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:42:14", "owner": "theflawedworshipleader", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920754928080438, "text": "Btw everyone it’s pretty simple to do this math on your phone and set a reminder lol", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:59:52", "owner": "allie.allie.oxin.free_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18143773753420179, "text": "This app is a scam. It charges you a monthly subscription after 3 days free", "created_at": "2025-10-06T20:06:21", "owner": "haven._.lad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533609227035959, "text": "If this was free, then it would totally be worth it but the fact that it’s a monthly subscription is absolutely insane", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:34:07", "owner": "allie.allie.oxin.free_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202394011313550, "text": "#ad", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:41:14", "owner": "godlyphilosopher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180548599342157, "text": "capitalism at the best", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:09:19", "owner": "melekniks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982605636913814, "text": "Outsourcing ‘having a think’ is wild", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:27:24", "owner": "rohaanmusic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058341548533579, "text": "Sounds useful, and how much does this app cost to use?", "created_at": "2025-10-06T06:04:39", "owner": "baseball.ryan08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857696665531853, "text": "You just gonna switch up on me", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:35:02", "owner": "popeyeschickin2christmas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847434766576365, "text": "I get around these dilemmas by just being poor. Is food more important? Yep! Moving on.", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:54:53", "owner": "audiomentor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889905331221864, "text": "She needs to make more money 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:58:59", "owner": "_max_cherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027957455526567, "text": "Clever idea but this app is about saving money wich I love but then you have to pay a subscription to even use it ?", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:43:58", "owner": "caylou09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532063642015789, "text": "App name", "created_at": "2025-10-04T23:29:18", "owner": "zaykhan2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129180949476028, "text": "I don't understand how times equals money. There is also no way that the app knows how much time it took based on a price.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:09:43", "owner": "arwen_hklx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094127041754710, "text": "Just what I needed an app to help me decide when I should purchase landfill garbage. 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-04T16:01:33", "owner": "mintyghost00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070043435245389, "text": "It's crazy but I can't try it because it needs a subscription and I can't save if I need to pay to save", "created_at": "2025-10-04T15:02:38", "owner": "avramidis.anto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093186097698916, "text": "this is greattt", "created_at": "2025-10-04T10:40:49", "owner": "nucleon_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18138836908433028, "text": "It helps me to remember to buy a new thung and remembered to buy that", "created_at": "2025-10-04T03:38:10", "owner": "alvnfaiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016235105785019, "text": "This is fucking stupid", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:50:16", "owner": "bradennoodler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073796963184519, "text": "Why is it not free", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:05:31", "owner": "dno2oo4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18387816064192151, "text": "That's so cool", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:12:18", "owner": "mohammadmhm3hdi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18481665484072412, "text": "Yeahhhhh with the amount of girl math I do that “money saved” number would be GONE 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-03T00:48:11", "owner": "justalillauren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18218573704307656, "text": "Its 129.99 go back right now", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:05:56", "owner": "harrisonstritthof", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084537580746553, "text": "I like the idea of this app. People who are complaining that it's a subscription are a bit clapped. I pay $2 a month for a fuel card for a specific station, I get all my fuel about 15c/L cheaper than market rates for my area.  Pays itself off on the first fill. It's free to do this stuff manually, but some people just can't do that. Seems like a win win having this as an option. 👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-02T10:55:39", "owner": "mooncake6009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084596233932373, "text": "Or just don’t buy stupid shit", "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:32:15", "owner": "b.garza7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091798003828574, "text": "Gotta pay for the app… trying to save money!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T19:02:12", "owner": "zac.r.law73", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026171831744642, "text": "I dont want to be in the store for an hour. No thank you.", "created_at": "2025-10-01T18:49:53", "owner": "skarchmit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422807077103200, "text": "I dont get it", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:26:57", "owner": "proste._.filip_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039827837467424, "text": "6h for 130$? Thats more than two weeks work for me", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:48:02", "owner": "fkn.o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18208751626308370, "text": "It was only 4 minutes lol", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:03:06", "owner": "naina._.singh24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053197559270705, "text": "How do I use this personally!? I NEED@this in my life", "created_at": "2025-10-01T03:41:50", "owner": "groom.jade", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18240370753290515, "text": "@downsizeupgrade", "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:49:09", "owner": "clara.cmartins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046140218355598, "text": "At least manually edit your time so the \"1 hour notification\" isn't 4 minutes", "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:12:26", "owner": "deagiejd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18293359204253997, "text": "This is so smart i do this without the app but I think I need the app now", "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:03:53", "owner": "bibikim__chi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080080621966033, "text": "welp, the app shouldn’t be pfu 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-30T19:51:50", "owner": "yu.smellrancid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977537484768093, "text": "Let me safe you the time. The app has 1,5 stars and only works with subscribtion", "created_at": "2025-09-30T17:00:27", "owner": "sesemaster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070066732968437, "text": "Nice, you need to buy the app 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T16:06:13", "owner": "justin.hz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018171290783937, "text": "Dont yall know your hourly wage or why do you need that app???", "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:35:02", "owner": "kittyraptorex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985782576891033, "text": "Get this away from our businesses 😭😭 Otherwise give me commission of What they have saved 😆", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:46:48", "owner": "kalkulacka__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057440783175785, "text": "Bit ironic that you have to pay for the app via a subscription..", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:12:07", "owner": "nova.aphrodite", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070102889185233, "text": "i made 130 in 16 h not in 6", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:23:11", "owner": "sacino__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852832825551927, "text": "I need this app for Android", "created_at": "2025-09-30T06:15:37", "owner": "barefootinbloom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18041235893460603, "text": "Oh there was no notification to think about your app 😂 mehhhhw", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:17:57", "owner": "letsliveintomorrowland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079900138966782, "text": "This demitted thinking is why wars start", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:58:11", "owner": "corsephone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063241748605666, "text": "It's a good app but haven't y'all been doing it in your head already. I mean money is power but the reason of it also takes your power and energy and life. It is a device you exchange your time for the thing you wanna spend on", "created_at": "2025-09-29T22:36:24", "owner": "_t.h.e__m.o.o.n_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121070062503515, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:43:35", "owner": "dioilham", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17971538849791609, "text": "That wouldn't work in Brazil, as it would cost 3 days of work under minimum wage", "created_at": "2025-09-29T19:14:06", "owner": "jumalbug", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17908286154235553, "text": "Good Demo", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:10:50", "owner": "proud_hokori", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867314104387143, "text": "We cocked💀", "created_at": "2025-09-29T17:43:25", "owner": "jazzi.boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088983175863677, "text": "I have a rule - if it’s not an essential, if I still want it and it’s still there a week later I will then get it, otherwise not meant to be 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T14:28:02", "owner": "avcmarketingllc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113068021540569, "text": "literally downloaded the app before i finished watching!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:49:04", "owner": "callieelizabethc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094745296687711, "text": "Bruh she makes £21 an hour 💀 im here on £12 and I have to deal with the general public... fuck retail", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:52:49", "owner": "jakescorneroftheinternet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986451468902715, "text": "Half of the feature u can do it by urself", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:56:09", "owner": "ngou_ling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848380129569723, "text": "@s.toopie", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:24:41", "owner": "the_pinktard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050038379641761, "text": "That was not an hour", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:32:57", "owner": "jamesisjazzy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977106966768981, "text": "She makes less than $22/ hour 🤔", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:18:28", "owner": "kandij.haag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002108324814489, "text": "Such a good app", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:25:56", "owner": "dimma_gaming", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080889428490538, "text": "The irony of having to pay for this app monthly.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:00:35", "owner": "elio8_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17912381487203363, "text": "What do they mean less then 6 hours of work", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:54:17", "owner": "xforevertakenx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066338543352247, "text": "it was 129,99 though, maybe it would’ve made the difference 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:35:32", "owner": "eva.c.ve", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17908818375238250, "text": "I have never seen anything more American. Just control yourselves and don't give in to the urge to buy.", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:29:33", "owner": "ben_bte", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18425895238103614, "text": "Nah that will take me almost 20h", "created_at": "2025-09-28T16:15:48", "owner": "popi.kajinka.popeskova", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064170245595619, "text": "@einfachleichter__  auch ein super Tipp um unnötige Einkäufe zu vermeiden 🤩", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:49:50", "owner": "kati0kunterbunt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963145866977889, "text": "I download it just to support you keep going", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:39:09", "owner": "erenbravoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057079847397616, "text": "Money saved? If it’s not a necessity it’s not saved it’s money not wasted", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:55:26", "owner": "mashim__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860419573500291, "text": "People cant even thing without app", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:26:30", "owner": "mandira_inegi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079440910989710, "text": "How do we withdraw money from the app?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:26:36", "owner": "pyrz.mp3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076687328008610, "text": "I need this 😢", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:03:06", "owner": "ayceyboy14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109837867494758, "text": "That shit was ugly AF. Can't believe it was even considered", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:35:27", "owner": "the.fullenglishbreakfast", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942371772930700, "text": "How ironic is that I need to spend money on an app that should help me save money", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:12:33", "owner": "ciggy.ke", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18083948278925426, "text": "I hope there isn't a subscription to do 80% of the things advertised on your page", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:07:59", "owner": "whyydrinoco", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18019856642581362, "text": "Reminds me of that movie “In Time” with Justin Timberlake. Spooky", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:57:13", "owner": "christlikejorge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869037889377013, "text": "This is amazing!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:48:25", "owner": "fefe_coelho.gonc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17973441833937798, "text": "¿So... I need buybye to decide if I want buybye?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:41:46", "owner": "x_izzo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924011170118514, "text": "Yeah keep tokenizing your human existence and time", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:32:20", "owner": "linception_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105590143524938, "text": "Is that 6h of take home pay or gross pay?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:09:22", "owner": "say_rini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082807808293489, "text": "The first purchase would have been 5 DAYSSS  for me😭 Latin American wage is a joke", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:57:23", "owner": "thelalalife.priv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157748269384092, "text": "Is this for kids who can’t manage their finances, can’t be for adults.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:03:52", "owner": "robbie_in_manchester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193447705322013, "text": "Meh, seems a bit pointless.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:03:16", "owner": "robbie_in_manchester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144496525419728, "text": "у меня есть  калькулятор и таймер, спасибо", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:47:48", "owner": "alek.murz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863048836413436, "text": "yall need apps to make decisions now🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:58:36", "owner": "preylot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093731302667087, "text": "I wouldn't buy anything if I calculated it in working hours 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:51:30", "owner": "tsunsica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860737492497630, "text": "How much is it to use this app?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:49:09", "owner": "rafaelaioli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051092396305834, "text": "Let’s keep using our brains for something please 🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:01:30", "owner": "saumya_111", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18081597805778131, "text": "Just put the 6 hours of work on blackjack bro its not that complicated 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:52:19", "owner": "toenails.cr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112501030540271, "text": "People need an app to determine how many hours they have to work to buy something? Smh.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:20:01", "owner": "brindlecorsos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050999090301876, "text": "It will get dirty anyway with the white fabric at the top", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:17:56", "owner": "nina.v.o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383046679130836, "text": "It was $129.99 that could have made the difference in the minutes 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:28:36", "owner": "danielrcoates", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125464105434422, "text": "I dont get this trend, is it like 6 hours of pay from work?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:38:00", "owner": "_justshads", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992106066699051, "text": "Useless app ever", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:36:17", "owner": "clem3nt_ctx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101662681527536, "text": "the real cost of a purchase is how much money you need to invest to generate passive income equal to the  cost of the purchase.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:25:11", "owner": "txchou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074231426516788, "text": "bruh, 2$ per month haha hell na", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:27:49", "owner": "ray7evn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995501217831944, "text": "The amount of money I would save if I had this", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:12:22", "owner": "imaaz_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141254380429738, "text": "This is awesome!", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:25:44", "owner": "mizz_ziggy1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18014937686609471, "text": "I thought I’m the only one who always does that, but I just went in my head. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:44:31", "owner": "herbienater", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948976714040281, "text": "It would be cool if you could add pictures of the item too, so you can decide if it even fits into your house later", "created_at": "2025-09-27T07:37:41", "owner": "saharcazm", "likes": 112}, {"id": 17969547437955057, "text": "I don’t get it… If it’s worth less than six hours of work?  She asking if this would cost less money than what she would earn in six hours? Or if it would take her less than six hours to build it.?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:04:23", "owner": "tica.puravida", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18078777386297363, "text": "Honestly props to you guys for so unashamedly creating the dumbest app on the planet and making people pay for it before they can even use it 😂 I respect the hustle and dedication to the scam that 2 calculations is worth a monthly subscription", "created_at": "2025-09-27T04:56:48", "owner": "leojboyer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074289542154064, "text": "4 mins apart tho 😫✌🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:55:55", "owner": "erhm21tk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17857027068520753, "text": "Don’t date the emo baddie Lloyd 😪", "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:24:45", "owner": "frvn2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985614189887724, "text": "@biochemistnikki", "created_at": "2025-09-26T23:16:47", "owner": "kaleidocat_jewelry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082829101745159, "text": "But its not free", "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:55:57", "owner": "azrart._", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18529596673062085, "text": "Paid 💀🙏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:40:14", "owner": "ezgames.site", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087657529700274, "text": "Ts itself costs money 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:03:55", "owner": "betyarbence", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18056396210624282, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:00:43", "owner": "maisa_parviainen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18104676298595711, "text": "@sofiaviscardi tell me she doesn't look like U 😮", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:37:27", "owner": "davide_peloso", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895473682311857, "text": "Where's the sense in paying to save? It's literally just about the cash, huh?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:36:21", "owner": "ali_kurecajovaa", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18090817516651713, "text": "Girl math", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:11:04", "owner": "tea__bjj", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17920070943159567, "text": "Android?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:23:50", "owner": "minionskopf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953494323877053, "text": "That’s so cool app called?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:38:40", "owner": "yaakov_rosenbaum", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18089479144880420, "text": "When he set the timer it's 2:20 and when the timer ends its 2:24?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:41:21", "owner": "moti_zini2", "likes": 222}, {"id": 18057050645393011, "text": "I don’t get it", "created_at": "2025-09-26T01:20:25", "owner": "landonwawryk", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18085226518912089, "text": "Ok new feature 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T17:40:02", "owner": "jessalynanne", "likes": 803}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3744072455644834768, "shortcode": "DP1ng-8COvQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP1ng-8COvQ/", "taken_at": "2025-10-15T17:12:00", "caption": "Framer is a free, full‑featured design tool.\nFor social posts, unlimited exploration, built-in resources icons and fonts. \nYou only pay when you publish a site. \n\n#websitebuilder #webdesign #nocode #webdesigntips #webdesigner #websitedevelopment #websitetips #socialmedia #icons #fonts", "owner_username": "framer", "owner_id": "3537851785", "likes": 67977, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0003_DP1ng-8COvQ\\DP1ng-8COvQ_20251015_171200.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18128757661477766, "text": "Name app", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:28:52", "owner": "maleka.oo1", "likes": 220}, {"id": 17977585229774353, "text": "So it's almost like figma now, wow", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:47:23", "owner": "adrian.kingdom", "likes": 1853}, {"id": 18432873886101973, "text": "APP NAMEEE", "created_at": "2025-10-24T23:40:32", "owner": "zhenn654", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065784149376753, "text": "keep your promise ?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:46:09", "owner": "_lufylon_", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18405922084143506, "text": "And it’s extremely expensive when you decide to publish. :) love framer but pricing is  ridiculous. No self hosting no code download.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T08:09:51", "owner": "discosapiens", "likes": 854}, {"id": 18021414926766639, "text": "WHAAAAAT ... my favourite design tool ... AGAAAIIINNN??? ... Darn it! If you insist, I suppose I must have more.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:07:27", "owner": "the.dzynr", "likes": 786}, {"id": 17976947798932994, "text": "Where can I learn how to ????", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:03:56", "owner": "nitya_and_socials", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933058761981720, "text": "Hi! With the new pricing update, is it still possible to publish a free site using the Framer domain? Also, could you clarify the new bandwidth limit? It’s not mentioned anywhere. Thanks!", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:26:59", "owner": "lorenzoguitto", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18013548605798879, "text": "Next canva?", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:33:55", "owner": "arieshonghuan", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18059688602167338, "text": "🙌🏻🙌🏻🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:15:33", "owner": "7lstudio", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075532907163729, "text": "Omoooo 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:26:10", "owner": "realfemigrey", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18083777498479212, "text": "🔥🔥✨", "created_at": "2025-10-16T03:49:56", "owner": "khairifadhil_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18077793710323689, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:18:35", "owner": "mew_positivity", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17962234781844307, "text": "Sheeshh 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T08:33:17", "owner": "axpedia_", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18410163352142026, "text": "Designed the website 😃 the design remains on framer forever🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:45:04", "owner": "itz.under_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103094806567141, "text": "Is AI involved in this?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T08:22:56", "owner": "sofi.ia_m0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073674847944840, "text": "Wwwwwwowowoww😍", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:48:25", "owner": "priyanshudzin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17864569212509323, "text": "never heard of it what’s the name of the app", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:44:23", "owner": "samuelesnow850", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160646200387392, "text": "can u guys get some new tutorials 🤍🤍🤍", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:47:41", "owner": "milkmybunny", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071226476195899, "text": "Thanks for forcing me to learn Webflow after all:(( new pricing is sick", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:12:23", "owner": "mariamd23", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17866567041481395, "text": "Do you have Minecraft font? Please answer I've been looking everywhere❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:46:23", "owner": "y000fy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18054024944279815, "text": "Emang goated ni", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:37:24", "owner": "ahmadabiyyurazzan", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18047248163689094, "text": "Because @alidevelopz  i start believe in framer magic", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:38:26", "owner": "souf.elibrahimi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17982322676754957, "text": "If Framer likes my comment then I switch from Figma to Framer ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:06:27", "owner": "scout.ux", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18022310156583703, "text": "why has your site just stopped working on my pc 💔 projects haven't been loading for a month or two", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:51:01", "owner": "roy08.png", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096191221686110, "text": "Why is pricing so ridiculous?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:56:00", "owner": "jottigg", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17865544653472790, "text": "@juan.vargasrosas", "created_at": "2025-10-25T14:34:43", "owner": "rpa_kbmx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119135560532466, "text": "You've increased the prices a lot", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:45:13", "owner": "eugenio_poli", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17935046889129314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:28:32", "owner": "zaben101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075190595195969, "text": "framer is it really true?", "created_at": "2025-12-20T11:19:19", "owner": "mangala_joe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080722880024239, "text": "@framer can we export code?", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:10:16", "owner": "tacodark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859895287455804, "text": "its free?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:19:15", "owner": "prince.qiora", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080031938025100, "text": "Only costless, not free. Don't fall into the vendor lock-in trap. The only freedom you can guarantee is in open source.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:10:15", "owner": "ber.yesa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060036956425762, "text": "is it free free?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:42:03", "owner": "black_syree_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18538908346063305, "text": "Is it free?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:49:52", "owner": "studiomarxtv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18136919614459447, "text": "Hey Guys you should add booking tools like Wix where you can create customized seat maps and book them for events looking forward! 👀", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:26:50", "owner": "samthecanadianpilot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967953738960430, "text": "How to start?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:21:51", "owner": "shawnidrissi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032204624716244, "text": "In framer we trust 🛐", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:55:53", "owner": "wayofmani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17912111580228392, "text": "is it free tho", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:59:40", "owner": "babadamino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089279968729118, "text": "Figma is better 💞", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:53:36", "owner": "iduw8w928", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023452094757989, "text": "Such a great platform — if only it worked for everyone, no matter where they were born", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:15:38", "owner": "meteorite.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022641245774898, "text": "For free?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:58:37", "owner": "not_delusional_niner_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103863040622090, "text": "How to download?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:59:54", "owner": "yavantejapodugu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926980639133924, "text": "No it's not free I checked to publish website u have to purchase it's plans", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:02:12", "owner": "two_souls1boy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070466939218157, "text": "Thanks for keeping it free finally students can use something", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:46:02", "owner": "shreshtha_hp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072799844221279, "text": "Can u give me link?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:51:54", "owner": "pirate.dazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101440075563337, "text": "@iamdan11 ok iki", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:54:56", "owner": "mrfachrez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167920468369625, "text": "Wait what I can design social media posts in Framer ??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:41:38", "owne