61, "text": "Woww😍🔥gotta try it!🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:36:46", "owner": "ny.graphic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060506411449830, "text": "I love it ! It’s so good 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:30:54", "owner": "ron.becker_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105576991611899, "text": "nice framer ;)", "created_at": "2025-10-16T08:29:59", "owner": "visibilityhero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094524850703383, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:07:24", "owner": "cloudcube.it", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080608565019180, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:22:49", "owner": "uix.veniceb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080351680854499, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:49:23", "owner": "zznyhq_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958412310865867, "text": "But what can you do with Framer? Check my website, link in bio, made with Framer.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:30:43", "owner": "itsuldn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18319755271245828, "text": "You made our business easy to manage. Forever grateful to all Framer team", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:27:44", "owner": "chris__lidors", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048885419661470, "text": "Framer is 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:06:26", "owner": "samwell.tech1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098792314709455, "text": "Framer is ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:20:57", "owner": "kushoys_lab", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053542439641007, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:26:58", "owner": "itsjmendez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057232142235233, "text": "Gotta love framer ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:21:36", "owner": "muchobueno.design", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17913549132211091, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:43:11", "owner": "uiux.asim", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967596849844512, "text": "Can I use framer in shopify ??", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:17:07", "owner": "prime_hector", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942686299096833, "text": "App", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:15:56", "owner": "binal_rajapaksha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111625822717443, "text": "100% free….. only pay when u publish a site", "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:52:32", "owner": "freakytoilet69ass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085236287010999, "text": "Is it available on Linux?????", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:15:33", "owner": "itsmekevin64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068959295607602, "text": "Framer", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:50:24", "owner": "k1vox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881479294427734, "text": "Zin zin hadchi 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:50:05", "owner": "elmi_anass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321832939172175, "text": "Pls link in my dms🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:39:11", "owner": "marooeslam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114462910582562, "text": "We LOVE @framer 😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:45:23", "owner": "callumlovekin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070605332597717, "text": "Framer is the best 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:24:34", "owner": "huspective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066371801574818, "text": "Crazy how it started as an animation library for React and now has turned into a website builder/design tool…", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:58:04", "owner": "sivert.no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994563543851247, "text": "Ur social media comments guy is so nonchalant im dying", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:24:04", "owner": "ruh.of.ink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930258838150609, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:59:08", "owner": "mamame_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863226439460634, "text": "Where can i download?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:27:47", "owner": "sylvielle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050889983398553, "text": "So it’s not free?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:04:18", "owner": "w.o.myself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086764370006666, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:41", "owner": "mohd_.anx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082855484323526, "text": "Explain me how do you get money and profit?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:35:52", "owner": "rajamakinathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087086866825006, "text": "Is it free tho?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:46:12", "owner": "onyxodone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066640130128215, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:51:31", "owner": "monkix.india", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158136715406225, "text": "Framer my best friend 😭♥️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:50:33", "owner": "dano.jly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096440857828857, "text": "Name app", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:46:52", "owner": "bangash_fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964572528849549, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:37:59", "owner": "r_4w.b_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000578366834136, "text": "framer is trash", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:19", "owner": "thep0ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064420301432326, "text": "How I look vs how I draw ahh 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:51:49", "owner": "manueldraws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147491107433393, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:16:28", "owner": "farman_siddiqui_043", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542400154023132, "text": "i love you guys by the way i just wanted to let you know…….", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:06:22", "owner": "dancingontoilets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543536434058500, "text": "What do you mean you only pay when you publish your site ?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:55:30", "owner": "hnc.051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027548408574178, "text": "I lpve you framer", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:22:41", "owner": "goofyaeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076509001969257, "text": "good ads", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:55:40", "owner": "xxefwy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958027506882419, "text": "Name?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:51:14", "owner": "jn.mars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890613943245824, "text": "Is this app available on playstore?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:33:46", "owner": "ibnuonly4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078606014176383, "text": "Nothing is truly ever free 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:53:27", "owner": "katherineyaitskov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086047087956558, "text": "I want to learn but i am too broke for this", "crea