ated_at": "2025-11-05T22:42:39", "owner": "vrana_s_cigaretou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098190664705500, "text": "İs it free", "created_at": "2025-11-04T18:08:54", "owner": "gokhan827028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892260850224634, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:51:05", "owner": "saad_megaiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176951212318195, "text": "I'm guessing it's not accessible for androids", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:24:03", "owner": "its_simply._.sarah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083326784072853, "text": "I won't make a website at the moment but this helps with inspiration. It's trully amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:56:16", "owner": "lumart_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093919351873414, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:48:47", "owner": "hamza_benabdelmoula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886100263261893, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:59:41", "owner": "naofumi_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974010603949135, "text": "How is it free if i need to pay to get my shit?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T11:14:17", "owner": "rooster.wild", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536827483015499, "text": "The cm deserves an extra fot this", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:16:02", "owner": "franco_cattaneo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855810517552900, "text": "@framer My friends, you uploaded content in Arabic to your YouTube channel. Why was it deleted?", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:53:28", "owner": "alli_alahmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062333105385932, "text": "🔥😢👏", "created_at": "2025-10-28T23:57:52", "owner": "au_mkarl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074916983175739, "text": "I don't believe it, can i get a unlimited premium version of Framer? Contact with me via DM.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:19:44", "owner": "alpkrdz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118496422530010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:28:19", "owner": "ba.um.thereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056721896273215, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:28:18", "owner": "ba.um.thereal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083627360075829, "text": "Figma is way better", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:44:41", "owner": "godscre8ion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976964328781707, "text": "Take my MONEYY", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:12:11", "owner": "dootsko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105418783714477, "text": "is this clanker propaganda??", "created_at": "2025-10-27T18:16:47", "owner": "starwberimari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156516319401693, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:06:38", "owner": "cryptounscripted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108558724588607, "text": "It's free?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:18:26", "owner": "a.molinari_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347462014167511, "text": "royalty free?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:14:32", "owner": "mistfll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947080920920349, "text": "Love it, but new pricing plan is crazy! Webflow is 4 times cheaper :(", "created_at": "2025-10-27T09:31:26", "owner": "kamildreem", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18120328375516100, "text": "Hey framer I have an idea, for these people to pay you for publish, have an option where someone else will ask for commision, they'll do it now they're paid to whatever subscription they're trying to pay for, so cool right", "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:08:58", "owner": "yakult_nakmuay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847016374592091, "text": "Can a site built built for free with framer be hosted outside framer?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:03:14", "owner": "dhillz.media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158782681401331, "text": "I was originally paying $30/month for my site with the Pro subscription. It is now $45/month. Shoot me a promo code big bro 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:36:02", "owner": "tnrxtech", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916148611071050, "text": "That's why I fucking love you guysssssss", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:59:07", "owner": "mohamoud_ave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070217477027469, "text": "Can you make video?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T23:29:30", "owner": "ebraz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082139812832319, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-2