58566436266, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:48:19", "owner": "ejike_uiux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966667119968664, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:18:09", "owner": "nwpall_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107958670593172, "text": "Love Figma but imma have to try this 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:37:25", "owner": "_whoisjustiin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041977490471044, "text": "Does it give me code?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:02:58", "owner": "muscle_thrust_keshav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881566222287630, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:07:07", "owner": "mavns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924293869120531, "text": "No code download, ew", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:22:47", "owner": "manu.pr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020531660769050, "text": "Booommmm🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:30:38", "owner": "thatwrapperguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047200088665501, "text": "This is sick🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:52:50", "owner": "jihananwar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920065300192432, "text": "crazy", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:15:31", "owner": "adityamulukuri", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["websitebuilder", "webdesign", "nocode", "webdesigntips", "webdesigner", "websitedevelopment", "websitetips", "socialmedia", "icons", "fonts"]},
{"media_id": 3713241637300747537, "shortcode": "DOIFZh0gD0R", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOIFZh0gD0R/", "taken_at": "2025-09-03T04:16:28", "caption": "Why is there no reflection in the photos taken by the photographer?\n\n#magsafe #magwink #photographer #cplfilters", "owner_username": "magwink.uk", "owner_id": "76266148271", "likes": 280888, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0004_DOIFZh0gD0R\\DOIFZh0gD0R_20250903_041628.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18522268366043400, "text": "How does it work?", "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:39:39", "owner": "yusufch1ck", "likes": 678}, {"id": 17982342596740116, "text": "Filmmakers in the comments: it's just a CPL filter.\nRegular people in the comments: what is the magic contraption? Does it actually work as advertised?", "created_at": "2025-09-16T05:57:44", "owner": "itsdondiestro", "likes": 5462}, {"id": 18056920622396321, "text": "No need any lens cap , just stick to the magnet, great", "created_at": "2025-09-05T03:33:26", "owner": "lumbierdi_alverno", "likes": 3320}, {"id": 18285010159285192, "text": "HDR off-on", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:42:25", "owner": "smn_nothing", "likes": 6318}, {"id": 18070099096917601, "text": "Did anyone get this and can tell their opinion please?", "created_at": "2025-09-09T11:06:20", "owner": "aminapanduru", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17920033263117860, "text": "Where can I buy this", "created_at": "2025-09-03T14:44:27", "owner": "d0.p8", "likes": 5007}, {"id": 18098913931616874, "text": "bro turned ray tracing off", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:51:12", "owner": "shakenstien", "likes": 34004}, {"id": 18052775549532230, "text": "It's name cpl filter", "created_at": "2025-09-05T06:45:58", "owner": "mykary_ph", "likes": 137}, {"id": 18079809571769557, "text": "Name of this audio ?", "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:27:55", "owner": "alen_inst_a", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17879699001400853, "text": "I lowk wish reflections didn’t exist", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:18:03", "owner": "komorebi_mangata22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108947338558347, "text": "\"i need it on my desk now!\"", "created_at": "2025-09-07T03:53:28", "owner": "are.be.you", "likes": 813}, {"id": 18048877961314808, "text": "That's how 3d glasses work too. Cool stuff.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:16:46", "owner": "_yuvi_002", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17886582927239157, "text": "Linkkk", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:03:09", "owner": "__.okspamz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095373580655973, "text": "Photographer here, This is a cpl filter or polarizer it is very useful for certain situations when you want to remove reflections from glass water etc.", "created_at": "2025-09-17T08:12:20", "owner": "funny10488", "likes": 751}, {"id": 18092775682742817, "text": "- For the curious-minded: the Polaroid Corp. was named after it's first commercial product, the world's first artificial material that polarized light (the suffix 'oid' connoting artificial).", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:21:32", "owner": "kevinbrownart", "likes": 96}, {"id": 17970413528794055, "text": "How much ?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:31:45", "owner": "ceyh7nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075272432024879, "text": "Polarizer or ND filter maybe a CPL filter?", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:43:20", "owner": "aaron_nichols618", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18023175662556550, "text": "Does it only work without phone cases or the phone cases have to be magsafe?", "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:20:08", "owner": "heyitssoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965758749809356, "text": "Guys, this is just a CPL filter applied to camera. Just get one and attach it to a filter ring for iPhone.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:50:50", "owner": "kilo473.mkv", "likes": 413}, {"id": 17981637089869099, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-30T23:22:58", "owner": "cindysears96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077786018016425, "text": "can i have link ?", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:25:47", "owner": "redamancy_dtri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924152248118543, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:40:13", "owner": "dezeal.khedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891615247203702, "text": "Gm construct???", "created_at": "2025-09-23T07:24:45", "owner": "mrfemboye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097836277725240, "text": "Link🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-01T06:28:47", "owner": "siddhu.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104509741573307, "text": "link please", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:17:55", "owner": "_shaikhsimran__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068417597262326, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T02:12:59", "owner": "rezatriantara_", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17963668494005128, "text": "You can buy these exact models on AliExpress for 3-5 dollars, this is just drop shipped for more from these people", "created_at": "2025-09-29T00:19:27", "owner": "coltonorr1227", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17938961106064864, "text": "Music name？", "created_at": "2025-09-28T06:47:10", "owner": "luo._jie.yun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070240859191616, "text": "vlud turned off world space reflections 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-05T21:10:03", "owner": "inderix02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098890912631866, "text": "Tbf the lake looks better with reflection. I dont want to see the muddy ground", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:55:17", "owner": "foxtrot.uniform.charli.kilo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102305905536292, "text": "My Samsung does that for free", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:20:50", "owner": "anko.s31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980205135862886, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-07T17:24:46", "owner": "paganitar", "likes": 256}, {"id": 17846133351577003, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-10-01T02:37:58", "owner": "and_cocoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949119865042978, "text": "holy shit we got the option to turn off ray tracing before gta 6", "created_at": "2025-09-29T02:52:57", "owner": "kalioz_113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986515758888834, "text": "WHATEVER THIS IS, I NEED IT ASAP", "created_at": "2025-09-14T17:39:15", "owner": "maitree.pazare", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081032987299524, "text": "Where to buy", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:08:30", "owner": "p44tko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962761635828403, "text": "\"cuts the polarization blabla\" they dont even know theres more than 1 kind of light. repeating \"polarization\" is just another word they wont research.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:15:10", "owner": "vaiktorg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152543677394683, "text": "Plz sent me link for this product", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:22:07", "owner": "srv_the_beard_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081198694981838, "text": "Dude discovered a polarizing filter😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:49:51", "owner": "danilo.petrovic.dani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069235964334239, "text": "Is this ND Filter or CPL Filter ?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:17:55", "owner": "_asyhab", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18080120743803723, "text": "Can you please send me the link?", "created_at": "2025-09-22T10:30:30", "owner": "imagensnoponto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067153031211313, "text": "Finally!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:17:06", "owner": "vian__shah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843254407566173, "text": "Lens name ? What's it called", "created_at": "2025-09-10T14:26:40", "owner": "umaro__o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074750879019237, "text": "Polarizer??", "created_at": "2025-09-09T06:30:51", "owner": "art_scribbler101", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17858833506436366, "text": "why is this music so magical what is this song", "created_at": "2025-09-09T04:33:43", "owner": "sushikooks", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18528664618018069, "text": "ND filter 🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-22T08:00:55", "owner": "meowster_cat_gaming", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853705060531986, "text": "Polaroid lenses?", "created_at": "2025-09-04T23:44:21", "owner": "keepdabeatrocking", "likes": 303}, {"id": 18234758035290128, "text": "Song name?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T00:14:06", "owner": "gabriellopesdeaquino", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18077773847318260, "text": "what is this tool called?", "created_at": "2025-09-21T15:38:01", "owner": "nick.mpf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856334947458308, "text": "Can i change the cpl lens with nd filter?", "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:09:55", "owner": "rqla_tkj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066118256013167, "text": "Btw y'all this is called a CPL. It works by having microscopic cuts to cut out rays that are perpendicular to the angle you viee from. Since reflections enter from a certain angle ypu turn the filtwr until the reflections are significantly reduced. Qprks amazing but does not cut reflections 100%", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:59:37", "owner": "emmanuel_torres03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116389522517214, "text": "@kydyuzhini", "created_at": "2025-09-15T16:04:17", "owner": "kelseydell07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131597422456347, "text": "Polarising filter.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:11:00", "owner": "xjr1198", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356544019095746, "text": "Polarizer are awesome", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:04:56", "owner": "faiiixan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083046266507466, "text": "What is the name of this tool friend?", "created_at": "2025-09-15T11:39:16", "owner": "cikopai.coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951889473878876, "text": "link", "created_at": "2025-09-16T07:18:07", "owner": "l0vejade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407974252114081, "text": "It's like 2025 vs 2015", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:29:31", "owner": "core.umair", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18042675812659008, "text": "- What's the point of asking the question, and then not answering it?", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:22:09", "owner": "kevinbrownart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849291811552393, "text": "I mean last one is literally not possible...", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:46:18", "owner": "draw_stuff_daily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18482379547075139, "text": "@hilmisyauqif_17 @mimiminoz_17 @kingjulioarz", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:08:45", "owner": "alexiemarlvie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892982875324877, "text": "Polarisation, just take your polarised sunglasses in front of the camera will be a same effect plus an ND (neutral density) filter addition. Its not magic its photography.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T11:32:30", "owner": "aras_selim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867519229444080, "text": "Link?", "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:38:16", "owner": "lyra.gabriel6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18261997873303092, "text": "Anti-RTX", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:51:59", "owner": "r4vezer0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080365432759161, "text": "Golek ngenean neng endi yo? @edoardophi", "created_at": "2025-09-11T04:38:04", "owner": "andra.yp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020857568764140, "text": "This is called polariser. It cancels the reflective frequencies of light. Useful for shooting showroom content where the glasses reflect too much. Etc.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:30:11", "owner": "kshatriyashubham", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356387074086934, "text": "Nk beli kt mana?", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:54:45", "owner": "salihsoot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055203308182559, "text": "imma need glasses with this", "created_at": "2025-09-06T21:53:00", "owner": "emanuele.ventrici", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17994024806823799, "text": "Do not get these. They will let sunlight in from the gap where its not touching the phone. I do not recommend, get a proper cpl lens", "created_at": "2025-09-05T00:50:59", "owner": "shotby_qv", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18164028466368333, "text": "Send me the link please", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:10:56", "owner": "chief_ziad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057685640435868, "text": "Isn’t this the kind of lens people use for movies sometimes?", "created_at": "2025-09-07T21:40:03", "owner": "acexo.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925303930104196, "text": "bro disabled ray tracing and put low graphics", "created_at": "2025-09-08T00:25:25", "owner": "_denis_carla_prvt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852806218536708, "text": "Link please !!!!", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:23:30", "owner": "drea.gomezb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015471209780434, "text": "Link?", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:53:38", "owner": "_tpce_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106408237560720, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:23:55", "owner": "aruntr.1991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059138825613145, "text": "Guys its called a cpl filter", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:38:47", "owner": "_gidjon_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078787843984068, "text": "Can I see over the clothes with it?", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:57:20", "owner": "ippai.10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104282245575483, "text": "Link link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:48:20", "owner": "gou_gokul", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077545298489639, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:28:00", "owner": "dhr_uvil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18401214436136224, "text": "@kydyuzhini pls review", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:09:19", "owner": "mashoreen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18134834920444969, "text": "@kydyuzhini", "created_at": "2025-09-04T19:13:09", "owner": "guilhermegoez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17923087845110832, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-05T04:45:19", "owner": "jainam_shah_36", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046856798638224, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:52:12", "owner": "sc1entifically", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049992119693195, "text": "Where i can buy ?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:45:57", "owner": "papa_kikinasarudin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907054153279919, "text": "Send me the link", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:23:06", "owner": "smayan_baid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079408037133037, "text": "They make very affordable sunglasses that do the same thing. Great for driving. \n“Polarized lens” is what you’re all looking for.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:56:15", "owner": "broseph_schaefer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092737804910542, "text": "CPL", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:17", "owner": "amaterasumin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124845673519563, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:10:56", "owner": "erdman.ania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969216489968733, "text": "im super shocked right nowwwww how did I know this existed?!?!?????", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:54:25", "owner": "charcharboinks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971599257800853, "text": "I want to buy please reply", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:23:04", "owner": "rohit_silent_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078797180135297, "text": "😮😮我有可以录制视频的收音麦克风，感兴趣就联系我吧", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:19:46", "owner": "aidi_audio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052485848656703, "text": "Now do it on the mirror!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:43:42", "owner": "vitxriacoimbra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928239208012351, "text": "Name?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:28:50", "owner": "malubarreto.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082023944054243, "text": "Polariser sticking like a magnet is a genius idea fr", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:27:16", "owner": "_soni.viraj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097443985776840, "text": "@kydyuzhini test this pls", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:52:38", "owner": "auvidusch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084564193807919, "text": "Kok tjakep 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:14:07", "owner": "dendhiyoanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853392376559681, "text": "@ulanzi.global can you guys make one 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:50:00", "owner": "isaacphotosj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060283913183382, "text": "the water just feels like you got low graphics on", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:42:22", "owner": "dzkmlr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096039868774673, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:52:57", "owner": "you.shop777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080720735473187, "text": "Manda para o Brasil ?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T04:50:44", "owner": "davidsilva408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912014515229009, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:52:48", "owner": "nosmokingvids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973834944948561, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:24:39", "owner": "somayeh.makeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128073844468078, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-10-13T03:34:21", "owner": "kdreamer__noona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088049497713404, "text": "Link", "create