, "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:52:19", "owner": "slicytaless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907092553227102, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:41:47", "owner": "meet.engineer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925275153996655, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T17:23:19", "owner": "hardy07_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095717386654566, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:42:51", "owner": "kunal_dayare07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875110984310231, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:15:55", "owner": "aj_dsilva1o1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918370846157113, "text": "link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:43:57", "owner": "xyane05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947738032011434, "text": "link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:33:22", "owner": "milind_0p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139716532425628, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:04:48", "owner": "mr.davlatjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925486224998050, "text": "Link", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:25:16", "owner": "kevinrozario_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108485716488049, "text": "Can we attach nd filter?", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:30:25", "owner": "datboi.aryanxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055561991529892, "text": "Cpl", "created_at": "2025-09-04T02:47:57", "owner": "mr.plopecional", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["magsafe", "magwink", "photographer", "cplfilters"]},
{"media_id": 3741801047678643751, "shortcode": "DPtjDpbEe4n", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPtjDpbEe4n/", "taken_at": "2025-10-12T13:57:51", "caption": "The best thing you can do when this happens is own it and shoot it again. #weddingvideography #weddinginspiration #weddingphotography #weddingvideographer", "owner_username": "pete_magazzu", "owner_id": "17679815420", "likes": 111144, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0005_DPtjDpbEe4n\\DPtjDpbEe4n_20251012_135751.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18081005690024935, "text": "I wish I could get that big red bar around the edges of my external monitor when I hit record just like how the built in monitor does. That’d be so clutch", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:30:56", "owner": "therealjasansan", "likes": 689}, {"id": 18398229277189695, "text": "Wow truly a beautiful shot there", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:17:36", "owner": "m.gutkowski", "likes": 7822}, {"id": 17889503418234239, "text": "Happens to the best of us", "created_at": "2025-10-20T23:12:32", "owner": "chrisbrockhurst", "likes": 338}, {"id": 18110521072573100, "text": "Man you have a good eye. I wouldn’t have recognized that I wasn’t recording till I sit down editing and can’t find the shot😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:05:34", "owner": "pats_lenz", "likes": 3642}, {"id": 18420803002107010, "text": "Pernah ngalamin😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:50:19", "owner": "chaidarghulam_", "likes": 1308}, {"id": 17854796391550380, "text": "Imagine one day your client is a filmmaker that knows where the tally lights are 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:51:50", "owner": "gatehi", "likes": 204}, {"id": 18085855273788924, "text": "No puede suceder mil veces, pero el sentimiento de terror siempre sera como la primera vez 😂😖😖", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:56:50", "owner": "its.jnero", "likes": 249}, {"id": 18080870785972646, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:14:17", "owner": "nizamdredd", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18060671480434958, "text": "Hermoso, quisiera lograr hacer esto que usted hace..", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:16:08", "owner": "the_ramvar", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18074733151995721, "text": "2nd shoot was the shoot😍 sometimes those accidents are a blessing.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:16:37", "owner": "g4bfloyd", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18297164203287693, "text": "Aqui a gente chama de rec invertido 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:39:17", "owner": "robertinho5583", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17903256573294415, "text": "What monitor mount is that???", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:32:34", "owner": "travisdennymedia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111855871497757, "text": "Why don’t you just add red light to your screen when it’s recording?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:40:52", "owner": "tiago.fxlab", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18043169435427440, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:07:46", "owner": "corderory", "likes": 147}, {"id": 18247543741292603, "text": "@heyder_cardos 😂😂 quien es?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:04:30", "owner": "bubucardos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093698374881248, "text": "But why is the timer still counting even if you're not recording?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:08:22", "owner": "bonnux", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18144756277436357, "text": "Famoso rec invertido 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:09:35", "owner": "junior_louren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066480512363476, "text": "What is the purpose of catching naturalness?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:02:10", "owner": "hmh_photography58", "likes": 457}, {"id": 18094479922684691, "text": "padahal lampu merahnya udah banyak banget di fx3 masih aja lupa😭", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:44:54", "owner": "faris_1.85", "likes": 86}, {"id": 17927349294136253, "text": "Wow! Such a beautiful shot. 😍 love your setup", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:27:56", "owner": "mlane.studios", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075399035180300, "text": "Wow powerful shot! Goes well with the music! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:10:40", "owner": "kioskflippingfilms", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860868622457963, "text": "😢😢🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:36:44", "owner": "ridwanard.id", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060351773179088, "text": "I love what you do, are you on autofocus or you do focus pulling with a focusring on the same time?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:06:05", "owner": "le_gars_des_photos", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18146366569419794, "text": "Joke about it even. Cause next time you say “got it” someone will ask if you pressed record and that way you’ll never forget again 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:46:47", "owner": "beka.nenzar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067209209595012, "text": "My only peeve about the fx3 is the red recording light not being more obnoxious 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:08:08", "owner": "bamariiss", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18086440360937375, "text": "Big Red light but 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:37:32", "owner": "hudaaprillia", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091755571868889, "text": "very quickly you handled the situation 😂🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:44:01", "owner": "crisxvisual", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071454359262358, "text": "Hahaha same i asked how u know its recording 😂.. its should be visible on screen i think", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:25:12", "owner": "just_malhar_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887376055245313, "text": "Smooth move😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:20:33", "owner": "ashmanfilms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100125646725315, "text": "\"backup\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:48:48", "owner": "rfl._akbar", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17921513175167955, "text": "Luckily you realized that before it was all over 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:05:14", "owner": "adibillahakbarr", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080105900062833, "text": "That was my 3rd grade teacher ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:28:59", "owner": "damato.lily", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950110704901249, "text": "“One more” never fails", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:53:05", "owner": "jfaro_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17913266079212571, "text": "That was close one 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:28:49", "owner": "taha.a.jawad", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17902644285167096, "text": "@shravan.cine", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:11:04", "owner": "sundar.arw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086809192785373, "text": "Once happened 2 minutes in ☠️☠️ Told them there was a problem with the microphone and restarted everything", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:19:06", "owner": "carimannola", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110024005583325, "text": "the rule of third is giving me adhd and ocd", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:07:18", "owner": "alran88888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125324299491517, "text": "HD 60FPS 🥴", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:04:58", "owner": "andriuw__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057551663532461, "text": "Inverted rec", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:50:32", "owner": "fabriciosouza.fot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117016888563102, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-20T16:09:35", "owner": "filmmkrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912331369254635, "text": "this dude knows ball with that sound choice", "created_at": "2025-12-20T02:29:15", "owner": "talens.film", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989683518864564, "text": "What monitor is that sandals can you set it to shot in vertical format?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:44:30", "owner": "rdphotographer__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906628840289426, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:49:45", "owner": "director_dwell_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870207301480306, "text": "Famoso REC INVERTIDO", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:14:44", "owner": "victorgmunizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918620512215303, "text": "“Lets do another take just in case” 🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:35:05", "owner": "oguilhermejoaquim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176329906368688, "text": "That’s me all the f time! 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:03:58", "owner": "ariefferdinand_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086077445080220, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:38:11", "owner": "___ct00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541531216016958, "text": "One more hahahahaha 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:34:34", "owner": "paxarph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031052927757245, "text": "@gudongz", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:37:23", "owner": "fevianb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301125772285258, "text": "That lens is doing some work", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:03:55", "owner": "manwithoutaname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093375508912418, "text": "If it's slog how is it so colored?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:29:20", "owner": "laurentiudll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061344278244546, "text": "Perfeito", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:43:25", "owner": "_renato_melo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138661264461299, "text": "Happens to the best of us👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:37:57", "owner": "jacobzatorsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115916386601300, "text": "What a shot!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:27:20", "owner": "lumiere_photocompany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065196632544653, "text": "What monitor is that?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:08:23", "owner": "jonathan.hosley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064825754169681, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:31:57", "owner": "mohammad_reza_qorbani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915753955088696, "text": "Which hdmi cable is that?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:43:31", "owner": "vmovsisiann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971385384968018, "text": "I say, just for safe! Let’s do one more 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:10:46", "owner": "danidealpha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089532905314096, "text": "What focal length was this shot at?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:52:10", "owner": "carswellmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897017740205548, "text": "Sering bgt gw gitu jg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:23:28", "owner": "rfqalalal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076002620195066, "text": "The reshoot was better coz of the wind look at ittyt", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:58:27", "owner": "witharianne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079166434908726, "text": "One more, just to guarantee 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:29:05", "owner": "mariomoreira13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860825755477637, "text": "Damn, get yourself an affordable Lumix S5ii! It shows the Red Rectangle while recording", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:50:56", "owner": "a.calculated.fabian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076998683238071, "text": "Fx saved your day 😹", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:29:15", "owner": "_prazoal_m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062265824207590, "text": "I would crash out if went home and found out i missed the shot💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:58:54", "owner": "maz_____99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095614729855790, "text": "Brooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:00", "owner": "viva.jkt48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990398778897221, "text": "One more for safety", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:55:47", "owner": "jsh_lui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868051177482420, "text": "Holly", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:00:22", "owner": "yurchikseven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094562596870800, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:53:14", "owner": "mooze12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542025829000507, "text": "Isn't the one in the back less right?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:08:34", "owner": "galihagil__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073955894020056, "text": "What camera? :)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:24:07", "owner": "mackenzie.blankinsop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086935561949210, "text": "Corner brother save", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:29:15", "owner": "marme____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103739311655935, "text": "That was so close.😬", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:19:27", "owner": "mq3ziz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867853345480909, "text": "Somethings are meant to go wrong ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:15:21", "owner": "dhaibham_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095130079857488, "text": "This beautiful 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:50:09", "owner": "videomaker.auge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991483404730213, "text": "Random but is that 16:9?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:11:57", "owner": "dyllyngreenwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046744055449424, "text": "me mueroooooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:40:37", "owner": "daniellaolazaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105497695653371, "text": "Famoso rec investido 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:05:15", "owner": "dedeusrec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083057099023786, "text": "😂😂 quem filma e nunca passou por isso não sabe filmar kkkk", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:59:15", "owner": "eugleidsonsoares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088761398292848, "text": "Are you recording in raw?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:16:41", "owner": "gabrielfsanches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349368856202642, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:11:16", "owner": "breezy.lt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961817745861732, "text": "What lens do you use", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:41:30", "owner": "liam.budai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069681203360997, "text": "But time was running kn screen", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:52:14", "owner": "me_hamxa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902195722167779, "text": "What is that camera called?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:33:21", "owner": "mx.m0nk3y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419479930139711, "text": "What equipment are you using?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:28:36", "owner": "alivia_schramel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079866890130821, "text": "Bro wasn't recording", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:02:47", "owner": "ayoub_raais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024359309781108, "text": "Gravou sem gravar KKK", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:52:18", "owner": "ocharlessantos_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095128834880421, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:13:26", "owner": "sukh_editsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918875872206349, "text": "HD", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:18:49", "owner": "albert.videomaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130964806489863, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:22:37", "owner": "leonardoliriano_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907043599269208, "text": "Oh my gosh she looks like my sister", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:03:52", "owner": "jackson_perry22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951020443029009, "text": "“Lets do one more for safety”", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:24:00", "owner": "budr1s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094043113866681, "text": "What’s the setup??", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:04:25", "owner": "mbparz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077139418935892, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:28:29", "owner": "im_sudheesh_ps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063123143618735, "text": "Where did you buy that equipment?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:13:57", "owner": "nikole.kc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988430907897188, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:04:57", "owner": "eumarcoswalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921358585050013, "text": "UGH", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:28:25", "owner": "rezafahlevz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107939359608881, "text": "The first take was better though 😂 jk jk", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:17:20", "owner": "effan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079456838326286, "text": "Why not just continually keep recording so you dont miss any human moments", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:43:59", "owner": "tld8102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084871903980469, "text": "Yep yep", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:59:39", "owner": "nothingstilldreams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062176877447379, "text": "Situation @chrs_julius", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:28:18", "owner": "adrian_mallanja24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078675044152257, "text": "What’s the camera set up here", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:03:07", "owner": "giv.elmore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063462566390622, "text": "One more 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:44:25", "owner": "filmsbyvarunmohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118651627541981, "text": "A devastating feeling 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:27:51", "owner": "__mr.hamilton__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984017925872195, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:38:48", "owner": "audiovisionpostprod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082945474988270, "text": "I am in love with this setup", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:43:16", "owner": "magiknightman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072286694245977, "text": "Kskskskskssk", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:53:49", "owner": "jezrael_dias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893783899348087, "text": "Can you explain little about the camera lens plz", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:26:51", "owner": "akashdangon.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086070442984360, "text": "What is it with the fx3 that you forget I’m asking from someone who has this happened but on cannon I’ve never ran into the issue 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:25:26", "owner": "visualrenegaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089144038937731, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:44:17", "owner": "imbader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105989722716227, "text": "What’s with all the dead space on the right ?", "created_at": "2025-10-31T23:58:32", "owner": "_superradical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138125782454117, "text": "I haven’t gotten fully into weddings and stuff yet, however I have been in the automotive videography business for years now, and I can confidently say this has never happened to me. Now that I said that it’s gonna happen tho ☠️☠️☠️", "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:59:46", "owner": "brody.harris.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073625492236829, "text": "Why couldnt they put the rec button near the shutter", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:55:04", "owner": "not_so_frank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144263113439135, "text": "Thats why I always put the beeb sound on", "created_at": "2025-10-26T21:47:40", "owner": "mowafi__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098580088739346, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-25T13:29:02", "owner": "colorist_ja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182453947349966, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-25T12:13:57", "owner": "hamza2004_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025496942758882, "text": "What’s your setup", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:56:39", "owner": "damnsevani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892275289351358, "text": "Worst thing about shooting Zam is, if there’s an error, it pops up on the tiny little screen and not on my phone monitor. I’ve kept shooting for like 10 minutes before realizing I got nothing. Thank goodness it was just a friends concert and got a wedding 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:06:12", "owner": "gryffinmorgan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18405182554142142, "text": "Smooth lol", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:29:47", "owner": "shootyourshot916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071104289192891, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:46:02", "owner": "lombana2.rich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037704263687779, "text": "thats y i always said one more 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:40:22", "owner": "singgihrinaldi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114776164553938, "text": "Man !!! need you in Brazil at my wedding 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:44:41", "owner": "janainamelgaco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007938605797578, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:34:34", "owner": "omarketingrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080537584861156, "text": "Hahaha the internal screaming of realising you’re not recording 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:56:09", "owner": "jgmophoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052124057636800, "text": "Love the sony colors…", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:48:06", "owner": "dinnnnnnn_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137959594394134, "text": "Nicely handed 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:42:43", "owner": "dignofilms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853622932512615, "text": "shit happens often", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:29:03", "owner": "rizframe_cinema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088806664908022, "text": "\"one more time for backup\"", "created_at": "2025-10-21T07:33:14", "owner": "petrustjoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541929340010025, "text": "7h de vídeo?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T23:10:23", "owner": "devydsouzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951185361905452, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:22:16", "owner": "amat1photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075441601936792, "text": "In Fujifilm XH2S, when you start recording, a red frame appears on the screen, which makes it much easier because it's disgusting to see that it's recording.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:11:35", "owner": "frapop_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18243646954292976, "text": "HD 60fps?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:55:59", "owner": "relive_the_day_filming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071993306224145, "text": "how do own not shooting a whole interview realsing at the end lol", "created_at": "2025-10-19T01:27:39", "owner": "jikader11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864700921474964, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:00:04", "owner": "riatbandeep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056641433241576, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:22:53", "owner": "alaa_ihsan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018548555788065, "text": "which LUT do you use?🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:44:54", "owner": "filipkratochvila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903882385269485, "text": "“Actually that sucked. Let’s run it back!” 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:18:35", "owner": "dlvpen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057786920547580, "text": "White balance spot on!", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:34:36", "owner": "vlomedigital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024815657562861, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:12:24", "owner": "victoria_filmsc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102660721714232, "text": "Smooth", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:30:21", "owner": "anthonyluongphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520962232043213, "text": "😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:25:35", "owner": "arun_raj006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858571717533389, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:33:22", "owner": "thiagoaquinodias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943841665072385, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:16:47", "owner": "fouad_abdallah.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924686395152629, "text": "ASR Belt | Pure Leather Camera Straps\n🎥 Premium Leather Straps for Photographers\n🛠 Handcrafted in Punjab, India\n🌍 Shipping Worldwide\n📞 Contact: +91 9877336514", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:58:08", "owner": "asr_belt_malerkotlasuhail.7570", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210324331308739, "text": "Don't forget this button anymore", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:59:50", "owner": "dimkadzyuba.video", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075248486143116, "text": "One more", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:36:01", "owner": "ak.74_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977042079925919, "text": "Pernah😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:33:21", "owner": "rsphoto.bulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309981031222299, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:56:44", "owner": "chrisretro24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024380123752677, "text": "Hey what lens is that shot on😍", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:43:06", "owner": "keith.roche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026154701554377, "text": "Hi why my atomos show me different but in fx3 it’s more right ?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:31:09", "owner": "nikotatarashvilii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079250537043410, "text": "Dolby zoom will look good🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:39:46", "owner": "ig.raj_games", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061655645140665, "text": "Witch lens you use here? 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:48:49", "owner": "arturbuchholz.pictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985528446890342, "text": "Yeah again! I’m going to start using the shutter button in the future so I can feel an actual click. That record button is terrible.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:34:39", "owner": "dudio", "likes": 29}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["weddingvideography", "weddinginspiration", "weddingphotography", "weddingvideographer"]},
{"media_id": 3735035681044262041, "shortcode": "DPVgymwDWyZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPVgymwDWyZ/", "taken_at": "2025-10-03T05:56:27", "caption": "College id free resources #studenthacks #studentresources #learntocode", "owner_username": "cs.aar0n", "owner_id": "74213355372", "likes": 48162, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0006_DPVgymwDWyZ\\DPVgymwDWyZ_20251003_055627.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18340379833204397, "text": "GitHub pro, perplexity pro, tidal student discount", "created_at": "2025-10-07T12:25:59", "owner": "dhruvburman", "likes": 2439}, {"id": 17884802862261935, "text": "Could we apply the canva pro for 1 year on an existing account already? Or do we have to make a new one", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:18:55", "owner": "matthewomid5", "likes": 154}, {"id": 18005951975651793, "text": "Don't use notion use obsidian :v", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:16:05", "owner": "sad_maxie", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18189988765322070, "text": "Thanks for speaking the truth 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:08:30", "owner": "matthattenismycity", "likes": 327}, {"id": 18050000171330662, "text": "High school or college only?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:49:56", "owner": "coach.khurram", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18295149631252582, "text": "whoaaa", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:37:52", "owner": "julia_jeon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067623524602871, "text": "Curso for a year, and google gemini.", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:22:55", "owner": "oscarxmz", "likes": 118}, {"id": 17999022770818565, "text": "@sulleysart", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:21:59", "owner": "hamxahkhan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17850202632572493, "text": "We have cracked matlab versions in our pcs :)", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:28:04", "owner": "yasser_mld1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18040260065482520, "text": "I got pycharm for 4 years for free 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:25:30", "owner": "mirtazayev_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099451105660574, "text": "i didnt even know about namecheap, catchall here i come!", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:52:29", "owner": "marcoajx", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18105682831542484, "text": "vintage ub id 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-20T23:34:22", "owner": "rocco.vince4", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063669875613034, "text": "LMAOOOO not UB", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:39:37", "owner": "grannydilffff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032658707709463, "text": "Notion is super clutch. Cursor kinda sold recently with their pricing", "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:58:27", "owner": "omarhackslife", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18059239451173485, "text": "Whats that pqge?", "created_at": "2025-10-04T00:29:02", "owner": "sir._baudelaire", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073342417973553, "text": "If your school uses autodesk fusion for any of the engineering programs. You can normally get that free for a year and it is renewable as long as still your eligible using a student id and .edu email.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T19:01:45", "owner": "3v4n_5m1th", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848030482546350, "text": "Go bulls", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:07:57", "owner": "currentpush", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18369862276147760, "text": "Gemini pro too", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:40:22", "owner": "jackcamps13", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18129794107474059, "text": "Are you studying at the University of Buffalo", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:32:58", "owner": "samandarqalqonov", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057853652560629, "text": "Are they only for US students or also for worldwide ones?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:53:30", "owner": "srgvsky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067594127581300, "text": "BlueBeam Revu for free as well if you’re in civil engineering/construction management", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:01:13", "owner": "1riley.o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086354410757215, "text": "facts 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:53:26", "owner": "essaystudio.ai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071245604084278, "text": "Levi’s gives discounts for being a college. student, T-Mobile, Hulu and Netflix do also", "created_at": "2025-12-20T05:18:42", "owner": "jay_lynn_rae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086898413051980, "text": "Fuck github, fuck any AI chatbot, fuck drive services. You dont need all that. Spend the time and dont give them access to your shit for free.", "created_at": "2025-12-20T00:58:50", "owner": "remus1379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543068083041544, "text": "SYBAU 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:44:33", "owner": "blancosplot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079875649949897, "text": "The same also goes for Highschool id for cheaper public travel and using unidays or student beans for discounts", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:16:43", "owner": "ddrizzy25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076863841969685, "text": "Do something @enrdi", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:21:04", "owner": "front_cs14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065751539392095, "text": "Google One\nOneDrive", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:25:45", "owner": "paxton.xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025710569771228, "text": "How can i use it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:04:20", "owner": "ahmed__boufrikha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071353883053774, "text": "Is it the same for Iraqi students ?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:50:44", "owner": "lbqr3940", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071925752599571, "text": "@spam_by_farhan", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:29:46", "owner": "artsby.yousuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109929031520910, "text": "Perplexity Pro ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:26:34", "owner": "koh.yange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099138613767359, "text": "@issylebron", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:32:34", "owner": "cee_the_donn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057395465640834, "text": "What if my is old and expired", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:42:22", "owner": "tapatia74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086774998980346, "text": "for the engineers you can get a fusion 360 education licence which is stupid expensive otherwise", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:53:31", "owner": "niru._.najian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113703520577022, "text": "Bro got the unc version UB card", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:12:44", "owner": "ray.alh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950842003043945, "text": "That’s a weird ub card", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:27:00", "owner": "abdullahhkhan05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125864263501575, "text": "Sending to all the families I know.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:54:33", "owner": "truwatson39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977200125939489, "text": "is this only while your in college ? or can i use the github thing sfter", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:22:41", "owner": "nyb4rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898501879332729, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:59:44", "owner": "lax5swim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086294272967570, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:19:04", "owner": "chop.ontop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879216391422386, "text": "Notion thing is a lie, cuz it doesn’t let me get access to", "created_at": "2025-11-01T05:19:55", "owner": "antishidden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086434786758725, "text": "Ahh yes sell your identity", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:32:47", "owner": "_.nonso._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849003592586545, "text": "@rjsiu", "created_at": "2025-10-29T08:36:15", "owner": "erickim3907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944561178935204, "text": "ah yes, how can i ever live without my student discounts", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:42:05", "owner": "the_enlightened.freshman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850250350579015, "text": "YESS, i obtained jetbrains pro subscription using my student mail! Could do that with github tho, cuz my student id is not in English and transcript was rejected as a supporting document😭", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:22:20", "owner": "mika_tadzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109426621523905, "text": "the local beauty supply store by my school gives us a discount if we show our id this is great", "created_at": "2025-10-24T23:07:46", "owner": "dyeractt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083217830482047, "text": "Preciate it twin", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:11:39", "owner": "finn_espinoza4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061207037166839, "text": "Use my refferal for 1 free year https://pplx.ai/mgercz1130609", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:02:07", "owner": "marcusgerczak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046595048384708, "text": "Is it only for american students?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:26:27", "owner": "wukson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088184341909829, "text": "Sometimes they let you get Adobe free... 🏃", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:44:19", "owner": "noctiphilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945735670063934, "text": "Notion is absolutely worthless", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:57:42", "owner": "iamrj.9", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17954723474882833, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:43:58", "owner": "_ellie._.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911833843234322, "text": "ALTIUM PCB DESIGNER THATS like 5 GRAND 🙏🙏for free", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:01:13", "owner": "itzmangifera", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["studenthacks", "studentresources", "learntocode"]},
